      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Today it happened right after starting the game. It worked first but due to some some technical reason I restarted my entire PC. The second time I started the game invites didn't work immediately. Had to restart again for it to work.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
